Evidence trail:
service-worker-utils.js lines 9-26 (REVIEWED_COMMIT): cache entry stores `{ text, fetchedAt }` without URL; cache check on lines 16-18 only compares time. service-worker.js line 18 (REVIEWED_COMMIT): caller passes `s.journalUrl` from settings which can change.
```
