**Journal lookup failures currently disable the blocker.**

If the journal fetch fails, the CSV is unavailable, the keyword list is empty, or parsing throws, the handler returns and leaves the blocked site open. Per the PR objective, these cases still mean “no matching keyword was found,” so they should fail closed instead of allowing access.  


